  "name": "ComfyUI_portable_torch_2.13.0_cu130_cp313_sageattention_triton",
  "description": "I recommend run run_nvidia_gpu.bat for more stability work with this comfyui build\nI put Extra_Model_Paths_Maker.bat if you need synchronize models path from current ComfyUI Build. Put this .bat file into your model path, double click on Extra_Model_Paths_Maker.bat and extra_model_paths.yaml will appear in model path. Then copy/cut extra_model_paths.yaml and put into new ComfyUI Build into ComfyUI_windows_portable\\ComfyUI . Now the models are visible in the new ComfyUI build\nThe build includes\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/StefanFalkok/ComfyUI_portable_torch_2.13.0_cu130_cp313_sageattention_triton.",
